  "description_short": "Family-run farmstall serving freshly baked goods, pizzas, and hearty meals in a relaxed country setting.",
  "description_long": "Klipheuwel Farmstall is a beloved Garden Route stop where locals and travelers gather for genuine country hospitality. The farmstall bakery turns out fresh breads, pastries, and homemade treats daily, while the kitchen serves wood-fired pizzas and traditional farm-style meals that keep regulars coming back.\n\nSituated along the R102 between Glentana and Klein Brak River, this spot combines the convenience of a well-stocked store with the warmth of a proper country cafe. The outdoor seating area invites you to linger over coffee and cake, or settle in for a lazy lunch with a cold beer. It's the kind of place where you pop in for milk and leave an hour later, having caught up with neighbors and enjoyed a proper toasted sandwich.\n\nWhether you're stocking up for a weekend away, grabbing takeaway pizza for the family, or simply breaking up the coastal drive with something homemade, Klipheuwel delivers that authentic farmstall experience the Garden Route does so well.",
